3.2 YOUTH EMPOWERMENT PROGRAM
Purpose
To equip young adults with skills, discipline and leadership qualities that prepare them for employment, entrepreneurship and social responsibility.
What We Do
•	Skill-Building Workshops:
Digital literacy, basic computer training, communication skills, teamwork.
•	Natural Farming & Sustainability Training:
Hands-on learning through vermicompost and Jeevamrit units.
•	Leadership Training:
Sessions on goal-setting, public speaking, values, and community responsibility.
•	Sports Culture Development:
Daily sports like football, kabaddi, running to build discipline and teamwork.
•	Career Guidance:
Helping youth understand opportunities, courses and career paths.
Impact Numbers
•	50+ youth trained in digital skills
•	15+ youth involved in natural farming unit
•	20+ leadership sessions conducted
